195	     * {@link #registrationDate}: {@code 'MINOR'} when under 18, {@code 'ADULT'} from 18 to 64,
196	     * and {@code 'SENIOR'} at 65 or older. Returns {@code null} when no birthDate is set. The age
197	     * is the number of complete years between the birthDate and the registrationDate (or the
198	     * current date when the registrationDate is not yet set).
